iPad / iPhone: Guided Access

Open Settings.
Go to Accessibility.
Open Guided Access.
Turn Guided Access on.
Set a Passcode Settings passcode.
Open Safari or Chrome.
Go to your kiosk URL, for example:
http://192.168.1.25:3000
Triple-click the Side button or Home button.
Tap Start.
To exit Guided Access:

Triple-click the Side/Home button.
Enter the passcode.
Tap End.
Android: Screen Pinning
The exact names vary, but usually:

Open Settings.
Go to Security or Security & privacy.
Find Screen pinning or App pinning.
Turn it on.
Also enable Ask for PIN before unpinning, if available.
Open Chrome.
Go to your kiosk URL:
http://192.168.1.25:3000
Open the recent apps screen.
Tap the Chrome app icon or menu.
Tap Pin.
To exit screen pinning:

Hold Back + Recent Apps
or on gesture navigation:

Swipe up and hold, then unpin
Then enter the tablet PIN/password.